# Trading journal rules

Skills: `/rename-screenshots`, `/green-reviews`, `/red-reviews`.

- Not financial advice; never place trades
- Do not invent unclear screenshot fields
- Propose renames before applying, unless asked to auto-rename
- Rename format: `Date_Trade X_Direction_Playbook_Green/Red`
  Example: `2026-09-28_Trade 1_Long_ORB_Green.png`
